<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Primex Technologies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Primex Technologies.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon, Read said analysts Thomas O'Halloran and Arthur Wise upgraded Primex Technologies Inc to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- cited &quot;blow-out&quot; second quarter results.</p>
<p>-- set 12-to-18 month price target of $34.</p>
<p>-- shares ended Thursday at 26-4/16.</p>
</text>
